  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d98cd832ffa5c754ebd797e06bee75f3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueManager
  dialogueBoxPanel: {fileID: 1624676022}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 509270506}
  nextButton: {fileID: 828655979}
  sentences:
  - Hellooo there, and who might you be
  - 'Player "name" '
  - Nice to meet you, "name". Now aren't you a handsome one.
  - Cupcakes are soooo in season, wouldn't you agree?
  - 'Of course you would. That''s why you chose moi. '
  - Now tell me monsieur "name" what's your favourite flavour?
  - VANILLA??? Oh, I didn't know that you were so...tasteless.
  - Oh, close enough...that's my cousin.
  - 'I knew you''d love Raspberries. Mmhhh, so you think I''m ravishing? '
  - Although disappointing, you are still better than that utterly stupid croissant.
  - 'Oh monsieur "name" you are so much better than that stupid croissant. '
  - All butter and no brains.
  - What happened?
  - So, do you see how strawberries and raspberries are cousins?
  - Well, let's just say that chocolate filled croissants prefer strawberries.
  - How horrible. How can you bare to live besides him in that display?
  - I desipse it as much as I resent his existence.
  - But you would never do that to me would you?
  - 'I would not dare to. You are too beauiful to let go of. '
  - Mmhh, is that so?
  - As long as you will always choose me then you may have all of me.
  - I mean, there's always a better option.
  - A better option?
  - A...better. better. better...better option than me?
  - You've got to be kidding me.
  - Oh, come on, don't be like that. I could still eat you. You know, help you out
    of here.
  - Ughhh, whatever.
  - Yeah, whatever. It's not like you're worth it anyways.
  currentIndex: 0
